<title>USA: Dow industrials down at start of trading.</title>
<headline>Dow industrials down at start of trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials were lower with bonds at the start of trade Wednesday after the release of stronger than forecast March capacity utilization and industrial production.</p>
<p>--Dow Industrials off nine at 6578</p>
<p>--Nasdaq Composite off five at 1208.</p>
<p>--S&amp;P Index off one at 753.</p>
<p>--NYSE advance/decline 240/382</p>
<p>--Nasdaq advance/decline 738/630</p>
<p>--The 30-year long bond up 20/32 to yield 7.15 pct.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1737</p>
</text>
